                                "sense_id": "1f0a55f4-adb2-3fa4-8835-d8848916c0eb",
                                "text": "[…] A pilgrim travels unsuspect, for who dare rob a holy man? and he is free from burgal dues; but if the goods be small and very precious, pilgrims may carry them.\""
