                                "sense_id": "e20ebef7-6b1b-338a-8509-47c745983aa1",
                                "text": "[…] Thy honour, hitherto unsuspect, will be known to have been but a shew, and shouldst thou seek thy defence in lying excuses, if any such may be fashioned, the accursed scholar, who knows all thy doings, will not suffer it."
